&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Elastic, the Search AI Company, enables everyone to find the answers they need in real time, using all their data, at scale — unleashing the potential of businesses and people. The Elastic Search AI Platform, used by more than 50% of the Fortune 500, brings together the precision of search and the intelligence of AI to enable everyone to accelerate the results that matter. By taking advantage of all structured and unstructured data — securing and protecting private information more effectively — Elastic’s complete, cloud-based solutions for search, security, and observability help organizations deliver on the promise of AI.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What is The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;5d7v0&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;637gr-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;637gr-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;637gr-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;We are looking for a Senior Analyst of Enterprise Reporting to join our growing team. The Enterprise Reporting &amp;amp; Analytics team, within the CFO organization, is &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;popover-trigger-:rm:&quot; class=&quot;chakra-text css-8zk7oi&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;637gr-1-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;responsible for&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;637gr-2-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt; the consistent availability and reliability of enterprise data assets and key business metrics across the company.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;5d7v0&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;6umgn-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;6umgn-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;6umgn-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;We partner closely with various Finance functional teams to provide the support needed in planning, forecasting and performance evaluations. At the same time, we own and manage certified reporting data assets used across the company, including by RevOps, Marketing, Product, and Engineering, to support trusted, consistent decision making at scale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;5d7v0&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;dsmn-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;dsmn-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;dsmn-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;This role is focused on business intelligence, metrics, and reporting. We are looking for someone who can take projects from end to end: understand the business question, shape the underlying data model, build and validate the reporting solution, and maintain and improve it over time.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;5d7v0&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;dpi2v-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;dpi2v-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;dpi2v-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;If you enjoy problem-solving, critical thinking, and finding insight amid ambiguity, we’d love to hear from you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-reset public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;5d7v0&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;7dl4n-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;7dl4n-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;7dl4n-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Partner with Finance and cross-functional business teams to define and develop trusted enterprise data sources, performance metrics, and reporting that support business insights and decision making at scale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;5d7v0&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;b9a8l-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;b9a8l-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;b9a8l-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Manage reporting and analytics projects from start to finish. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;popover-trigger-:ro:&quot; class=&quot;chakra-text css-bcri66&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;b9a8l-1-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;This involves gathering requirements, transforming data, delivering dashboards, validating results, and enabling stakeholders.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;5d7v0&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;2ubu8-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;2ubu8-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;2ubu8-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Build and improve analytical data models and transformations in BigQuery, ensuring data assets are &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;popover-trigger-:rq:&quot; class=&quot;chakra-text css-8zk7oi&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;2ubu8-1-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;accurate&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;2ubu8-2-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;, scalable, performant, and appropriate for certified reporting.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;5d7v0&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;1nmv8-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;1nmv8-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;1nmv8-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Develop clear, intuitive Tableau, Sigma, and other reporting experiences that help stakeholders understand business performance and take action.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;5d7v0&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;1ia4v-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;1ia4v-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;1ia4v-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Support data certification, metric definition, documentation, and data-quality monitoring to maintain confidence in key enterprise reporting.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;5d7v0&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;a3nou-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;a3nou-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;popover-trigger-:rs:&quot; class=&quot;chakra-text css-bcri66&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;a3nou-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Perform quantitative analysis and data mining to identify insights beyond the immediate request; proactively identify opportunities for follow-up analysis, automation, and process improvement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;5d7v0&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;6furb-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;6furb-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;6furb-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Improve existing reports, data models, and workflows for accuracy, usability, performance, and maintainability.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You Bring&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-reset public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;5d7v0&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;7fuha-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;7fuha-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;7fuha-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;5+ years of relevant experience in business analytics, business intelligence, data analytics, or data modeling. Experience supporting Finance, Revenue, Go-to-Market, or other enterprise business functions is preferred.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;5d7v0&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;1lmme-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;1lmme-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;1lmme-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;4+ years of Tableau experience, including data-source development, measure definition, dashboard design, and ongoing dashboard maintenance. Experience with Sigma or other modern BI tools is a plus.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;5d7v0&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;91oe2-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;91oe2-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;91oe2-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;4+ years of SQL experience and hands-on experience with BigQuery (or similar cloud data platforms) for data transformation and analytical data modeling. You are comfortable &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;popover-trigger-:ru:&quot; class=&quot;chakra-text css-1j6t0d7&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;91oe2-1-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;independently&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;91oe2-2-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt; reading, writing, debugging, and improving SQL code. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;popover-trigger-:r10:&quot; class=&quot;chakra-text css-1j6t0d7&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;91oe2-3-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Practical&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;91oe2-4-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt; experience building data pipelines with dbt and managing collaborative version control using Git is a plus.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;5d7v0&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;6q0ll-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;6q0ll-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;6q0ll-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Ability to translate business needs into reliable data models, metrics, analysis, and reporting—and to own the work through a complete, production-ready solution rather than only one part of the process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;5d7v0&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;c44vv-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;c44vv-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;c44vv-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Expert visual judgment and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;popover-trigger-:r12:&quot; class=&quot;chakra-text css-1h4n5cs&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;c44vv-1-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;familiarity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;c44vv-2-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt; with modern dashboard design principles; able to create reporting that is clear, focused, and useful for the intended audience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;5d7v0&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;5ii0k-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;5ii0k-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;5ii0k-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;A &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;popover-trigger-:r14:&quot; class=&quot;chakra-text css-1j6t0d7&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;5ii0k-1-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;proactive&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;5ii0k-2-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;, self-directed working style. You look beyond the assigned request to identify relevant insights, issues worth investigating, and opportunities to make future reporting more scalable.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;5d7v0&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;e90ak-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;e90ak-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;e90ak-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Openness to new tools and approaches, including AI-assisted development and analytics workflows, while maintaining &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;popover-trigger-:r16:&quot; class=&quot;chakra-text css-1j6t0d7&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;e90ak-1-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;strong&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;e90ak-2-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt; core analytical and technical skills.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-listLTR&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;5d7v0&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;5ub85-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;5ub85-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;5ub85-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Robust communication skills and the ability to work proficiently with both technical and business partners in a fast-moving environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Additional Information - We Take Care of Our People&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a distributed company, diversity drives our identity. Whether you’re looking to launch a new career or grow an existing one, Elastic is the type of company where you can balance great work with great life. Your age is only a number. It doesn’t matter if you’re just out of college or your children are; we need you for what you can do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We strive to have parity of benefits across regions and while regulations differ from place to place, we believe taking care of our people is the right thing to do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive pay based on the work you do here and not your previous salary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health coverage for you and your family in many locations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to craft your calendar with flexible locations and schedules for many roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous number of vacation days each year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Increase your impact - We match up to $2000 (or local currency equivalent) for financial donations and service&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Up to 40 hours each year to use toward volunteer projects you love&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embracing parenthood with minimum of 16 weeks of parental leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Different people approach problems differently. We need that. Elastic is an equal opportunity employer and is committed to creating an inclusive culture that celebrates different perspectives, experiences, and backgrounds. Qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, ethnicity, color, religion, sex, pregnancy, sexual orientation, gender perception or identity, national origin, age, marital status, protected veteran status, disability status, or any other basis protected by federal, state or local law, ordinance or regulation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We welcome individuals with disabilities and strive to create an accessible and inclusive experience for all individuals. To request an accommodation during the application or the recruiting process, please email &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:candidate_accessibility@elastic.co&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;candidate_accessibility@elastic.co&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;gmail_default&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;We will reply to your request within 24 business hours of submission.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Applicants have rights under Federal Employment Laws, view posters linked below:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/WHD/legacy/files/fmlaen.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Family and Medical Leave Act (FMLA)&lt;/a&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Poster;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/ofccp/pdf/pay-transp_%20English_formattedESQA508c.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Pay Transparency Nondiscrimination Provision&lt;/a&gt; Poster; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/WHD/legacy/files/eppabw.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Employee Polygraph Protection Act (EPPA)&lt;/a&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Poster and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/OFCCP/regs/compliance/posters/pdf/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Know Your Rights&lt;/a&gt; (Poster)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Elasticsearch develops and distributes technology and information that is subject to U.S. and other countries’ export controls and licensing requirements for individuals who are located in or are nationals of the following sanctioned countries and regions: Belarus, Cuba, Iran, North Korea, Syria, or Russia, including the Ukrainian territories annexed by Russia (The Crimea region of Ukraine, The Donetsk People&#39;s Republic (DNR), The Luhansk People&#39;s Republic (LNR), Kherson or Zaporizhzhia). If you are located in or are a national of one of the listed countries or regions, an export license may be required as a condition of your employment in this role. Please note that national origin and/or nationality do not affect eligibility for employment with Elastic.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please see&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.elastic.co/legal/applicant-privacy-statement&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.elastic.co/legal/applicant-privacy-statement&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1611068262479000&amp;amp;usg=AFQjCNG3orAPk5sJIr9WVm0ZDxYw82c5DA&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;for our Privacy Statement.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
